WEBVTT

00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:36.240
They completely outwitted us.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:38.740
We even received support
from the New York branch, and yet...

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:40.530
I'm sorry.

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:42.950
What have the Sinners done since then?

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:46.330
Right now, nothing. It's just that...

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:50.580
There have been strange
movements in the Astral Line.

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:52.960
Yes, I have heard the report.

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:56.970
And how is everyone doing?

00:01:56.970 --> 00:01:59.180
It seems like they can feel something,

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:00.970
but there hasn't been anything definite.

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:03.970
We put together
such a large-scale battle plan,

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:05.980
but the result was
effectively a crushing defeat.

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:07.560
If we bungle this...

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:11.150
But there are three Sinners remaining.

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:13.190
We cannot afford to give up.

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:16.190
After all, the gates will not
open for those who do not seek it.

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:20.070
Then please take care of things.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:22.910
How did it go?

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:25.660
It looks like they've
suffered quite a few casualties.

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:26.910
In any case,

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:29.420
we need to speed up reinforcing
their personnel and equipment.

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:32.540
And it looks like we have no time either.

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:51.980
Sister Rosette...

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:54.940
Oh,I'm sorry,Minister Gilliam.

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:57.690
We still don't know
the whereabouts of the Sinners.

00:02:57.690 --> 00:02:59.650
Would you mind waiting a little more?

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:04.910
That's not it. Is there
anything that we can help with?

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:08.910
They've suffered such
casualties, and yet everyone is...

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:12.750
When the time comes, I plan on
asking for your help, no holds barred.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:16.170
But right now, getting rest comes first.

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:18.510
We can't rest at a time like this!

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:21.260
You've all been hurt too, right?

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:24.430
When the time comes, if you guys can't
move, then this would all be for nothing.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:25.640
But!

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:26.720
Rosette...

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:32.190
Let us work too.

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:45.030
She doesn't give up,
is self-sacrificing and beautiful.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:47.330
Just what I would expect
from Mary of Magdalene.

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:50.120
She certainly is
worthy of being loved by God.

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:54.290
That was meant to be praise.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.760
Can you see it as well?

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:03.930
The causality is absolute.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:06.970
No matter how much you try
to deny it, you cannot escape it.

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:10.520
Now that things have come
to this, what are you afraid of,

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:12.140
you who killed
one hundred million of your brethren?

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:13.690
Don't say that...

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:16.730
It is our fate to kill and consume.

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:18.860
Your power is frightening,

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:21.150
but there is no need for
you to be embarrassed about it.

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:23.400
You had a purpose, right?

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:37.460
I don't know...

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:40.300
If you stop moving,
then all that will happen is your death.

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:44.130
Well, you're free to
make that choice as well.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:48.010
Though right now,
we cannot afford to die.

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:54.980
Okay then, please wait for a moment.

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:01.980
Roset...

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:06.240
Sister! Sister, are you all right?

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:09.620
What? Oh, I'm all right,
so please don't worry.

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:11.040
Really?

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:14.080
Yes,thank you for your concern.

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.690
Is something the matter?

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:43.900
Oh, what?

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:46.400
It appeared that you were
concerned about something.

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:49.700
Oh, no, concerned
about something? Not at all.

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:51.780
Really?

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:53.120
Yes!

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:57.000
In that case, would it be
all right to make a side stop?

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:58.330
A side stop?

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:01.750
Yes, the weather today is fine,

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:04.590
so let us take a road
different from our usual one.

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:09.300
We may discover something new after all.

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:16.270
I'm back...

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:17.690
Rosette!

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:21.400
I've been waiting for you!

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:22.190
What?

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:24.570
Let's go out! Please get ready!

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:26.150
Go out?

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:29.410
Azmaria, where are
you planning on taking us?

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:31.280
It's a secret! Where's Chrono?

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:32.990
It looked like he was in the garden, why?

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:34.290
I'll go get him!

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:37.080
Hold on!

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:41.750
What is with her?

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:42.790
Who knows?

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:12.450
A fair?

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:13.490
It looks like it.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:15.870
Now, everyone, let's go!

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:19.660
Hold on, Az, this is no time
for us to be playing around.

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:22.670
That's right. I was wondering
exactly where you were taking us,

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.630
and for it to be a noisy,
common place like this...

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:27.760
The 'Cisco branch is
in dire straits right now.

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:29.800
You know that too, right, Az?

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:32.930
We don't even know
where the Sinners went either.

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:36.430
Steiner, we're going home.
Please bring the car around.

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:43.600
But us being fretful right now
won't accomplish anything.

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:48.070
Right now, we're all unorganized.

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:52.400
Even if we're living together,
it feels like we're in different places.

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:53.910
That's why I...

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:58.120
Rosette, Chrono, Miss Satella,

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:00.120
please don't bear it by yourselves.

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:03.000
"When you're having fun, have fun,

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.920
and when you want
to cry, cry your eyes out.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:08.090
When you keep
the problems to yourself and smile,

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:10.210
the person that it's hardest on is you."

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:13.930
You're the one who
said that, right, Rosette?

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:14.970
Az...

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:20.470
She's learned to speak her mind.

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:21.230
What?

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:22.940
Let's go.

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:26.150
I'm sorry about earlier.

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:29.400
I will try to enjoy
common-folk things once in a while too.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:30.730
Miss Satella...

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:33.650
Steiner, we don't need the car now.

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:35.410
As you wish.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:38.780
This is my first time to an American fair.

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:40.200
Oh, really?

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:42.290
Then maybe I'll spend the whole
day with you, until the very end

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:45.250
Nothing will start if
I just brood over it, huh?

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.250
Let's go!

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:47.840
Hey!

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:50.130
Wait up, include us too!

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:51.420
Yes, with pleasure!

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:52.670
Here we go!

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:53.670
Right!

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.390
Things are certainly lively today.

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:05.100
It's a fair after all!

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:06.980
I see...

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:11.020
Dressing up, dressing up with twitchy ears!

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:12.190
This is stupid!

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:15.780
And for the big loser, some twitchy ears!

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:16.780
Shut up!

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:20.160
He got mad, he got mad! Yay!

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:24.460
What? Roger!

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:31.340
Aion, I'll go too.
I'm feeling really good today.

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:33.800
It feels like my head is clear.

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:35.760
It looks like something
good is going to happen, doesn't it?

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:36.760
Yeah...

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:40.350
It <i>is</i> a party after all.

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:43.020
It would be best for there
to be a lot of people in the gallery.

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:46.850
Lord Aion, in that case, I will

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:47.810
It's all right.

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:49.270
Damn!

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:52.690
Oh, Fi my dear,
you're not going to dress up?

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:53.650
What?

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:56.740
Tada! Doggy ears!

00:09:56.740 --> 00:10:00.950
Well, accessories are inappropriate
for someone in my position.

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:04.620
What?
But I think they look good on you.

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:12.590
Let's go then.

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:14.800
To the stage.

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:18.220
Tonight's guest of honor is waiting.

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:06.100
And this...

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:20.650
Thanks for the potato, Satella.

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:37.130
Wow, everyone's pretty good.

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:41.630
Please dance with me for one song.

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:43.840
Certainly.

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:51.350
Now, shall we?

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:57.940
Somehow, she seems like
a princess from a fairy tale.

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:01.320
I wonder? Once she starts dancing,
her lack of talent will be exposed...

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:13.960
Miss Satella's so wonderful.

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:15.580
You're right...

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:17.170
Aren't you going to dance, Rosette?

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:18.210
What?

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:19.760
I...

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:24.800
Rosette?

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:29.680
Just you watch! Here we go, Chrono!

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:30.720
What?!

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:35.730
And a one and a two...

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:39.480
This is impossible!

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:43.860
Shut up! I haven't danced
since I was eleven, at Easter.

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:47.700
Right, put your foot forward there.

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:48.990
Like this?

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:51.580
Sorry, that wasn't on purpose!

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:09.680
Rosette!

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:33.540
Now, let's continue.

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:41.380
Mr. Steiner...

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:46.550
Thank you very much for today.

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:50.720
Would you please
dance with me for one song?

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:53.180
It would be my pleasure.

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:08.950
Okay, smile! Here we go!

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:09.910
All right!

00:14:13.030 --> 00:14:14.580
Did you take it already?

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:17.250
Oh no, I think I might
have shut my eyes just now.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.960
We're going through a lot
of trouble for this memento,

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:21.380
so don't make an unsightly face, okay?

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:23.090
You're saying those kinds of things again!

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:24.630
Now, now, you two...

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:25.670
Can you say for sure

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:26.840
that you didn't shut your eyes?

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:34.140
I'll deliver it in about a week.

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:35.310
All right.

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:41.060
To the Order?

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:43.360
Well, we're busy, right?

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:45.570
This way, it'll get to us
no matter where we are.

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:46.860
That's true.

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:49.320
I wonder how the picture will turn out?

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:51.360
We got it taken at a place like this,

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:53.330
so I wouldn't get your hopes up.

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:56.120
Don't say things like that
in front of the guy who works here!

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:57.160
Hello...

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:02.080
Lively,isn't it?

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:05.670
Yeah, it feels like the incident
from just before was only a dream.

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:06.800
Want to go later?

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:10.300
Stop talking nonsense.
We'd catch hell from the Minister.

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:11.800
I guess that's true.

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:17.600
Chrono!

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:20.690
What, have you lost track of him?

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:23.650
Jeez, what is he doing?

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:25.190
I'm going to go and look for him for a bit.

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:26.860
I'll go too.

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:32.240
It <i>is</i> a fair after all.

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:34.620
Let's leave them to themselves for once.

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:44.500
Isn't it strange?

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:47.630
Before I knew it,
I started to cheer them on.

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:49.760
Even though I thought
there was something wrong

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.760
with a human and a devil as a couple.

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:55.100
I was also surprised at first.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:16:02.350
I wonder if I'll ever find
someone that I can trust like that too?

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:04.350
I'm sure you will.

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:08.690
I want them to be happy,

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:11.950
and of course, I want you to be as well.

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:13.360
Miss Satella...

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:17.780
You'll definitely be able
to be happy too, Miss Satella!

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:20.250
I'll pray for that every day, so...

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:21.250
What?

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:26.920
Thank you.

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:32.880
The stone is shining.

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:33.840
What?

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:37.850
It looks like I'll finally be able
to fight alongside the rest of you too.

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:42.430
Hold on, Azmaria,
in front of all these people...

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:45.440
Look, Azmaria, I got it now, so...

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:49.190
Chrono!

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:52.780
What are you doing in a place like this?

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:53.820
Well, that is...

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:55.200
Come on, we're going.

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:01.240
Seriously, stop causing
trouble for me. It's embarrassing.

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:02.750
Sorry...

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:03.710
Huh?

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:08.420
What the?

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:11.840
It couldn't be that we're lost, right?

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:13.470
Well...

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:17.300
Man, you're hopeless.
For now, let's head out to an open area.

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:30.650
Rosette...

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:34.240
Rosette... Rosette...

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:35.400
Rosette!

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:38.280
What are you doing, spacing out like that?

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:39.280
Look.

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:50.670
It's beautiful...

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:53.210
Getting lost might not be
so bad, since we found this.

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:04.600
Hey,Chro...

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:07.980
Is something the matter?

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:12.520
Nothing, for some reason,
this just reminds me of something.

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:16.240
This resembles a view from long ago.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:21.320
That's what's unfair about you, you know?

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:22.490
What is?

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:23.990
The fact that you don't change.

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:26.710
Four years ago, and long before that...

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:31.420
You've lived a long
time with the same shape.

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:34.800
I'm sure that you'll stay
the same, even after I die

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:35.840
Cut it out!

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:41.430
The moment you die,
I will cease to exist in this world as well.

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:47.430
I have no intentions
of living longer than you.

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:50.190
But Chrono,I...

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:51.900
I want to change things.

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:56.150
I want to believe that there
isn't anything that can't be changed.

00:18:57.070 --> 00:18:58.150
Chrono...

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:05.410
Ever since I met you,
a new world has opened up for me.

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:09.120
For me, who had been wandering
about the darkness for a long time,

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:11.120
it was a light that brought me happiness.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:13.960
It's thanks to you.

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:19.760
That's not true, I'm the same.

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:21.760
But I've shortened your

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:23.800
It's because the time I have is limited

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:26.060
that I have no time to have doubts.

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:28.680
It's thanks to this that I realized that.

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:32.770
That's why I can walk straight ahead.

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:37.940
The reason I can continue without
stopping is because you're with me.

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:45.620
I won't let you die, no matter what.

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:50.410
No matter what it takes, I will...

00:20:16.310 --> 00:20:25.030
Rosette?

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:26.320
Please move!

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:27.660
Wait!

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:29.240
Rosette!

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:56.690
Joshua...
